#!/usr/bin/rexx
/* File:          01-helloworld-clr.rxj
 * Description:   Simple output of "Hello World" via .NET/CLR classes.
 * Shows:         - Import of a .Net/CLR class
 *                - Invoking the static method "WriteLine" with an argument
 *
